    "userProblem": "P1-6b retains task decisions and atomic rerun requests, but live local and selected-host cancellation and durable terminal acknowledgment are incomplete.",
    "requiredOutcomes": [
      "Exactly one task decide action with principal, expected version and decision ID; stable shared-applier replay.",
      "Persist human, guard and task-backed Ctrl-C cancellation before signalling the exact owned local or selected-host run.",
      "Hold the attempt fence until exact reserved cancelled terminal persistence and atomic store acknowledgment; consume replacement once afterward.",
      "Deterministic authorization, persistence, lost-acknowledgment, lease/heartbeat, reopen and replay regressions without stale launches or duplicate accounting.",
      "Final-source V1/V2/V11, affected aggregates and strict changed-file SwiftLint; independent test-integrity, adversarial and Astra integration review; exact-file commit and non-force push."
    ],
    "nonGoals": [
      "P1-6d director execution",
      "P1-7a/b legacy removal and examples",
      "Parent P1 closure",
